WEBVTT

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:07.150
Team Ragnarok, why are your D-Wheels working?

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.020
You haven't figured it out?

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:12.650
It's because of this.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:15.450
The Rune Eye?

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:22.040
Just like how Iliaster couldn't affect us, 
negative Moment can't affect us either.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:25.110
I see!  That means our D-Wheels...

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:32.320
They work!

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.150
We can still ride!

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:35.070
Yeah!

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:37.040
Hooray!

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:42.400
We can go to Ark Cradle.

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.120
That would be a mistake.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:47.190
Sherry!

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:48.810
You're alive!

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:49.800
Ma'am!

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:54.540
Yusei, I've seen the future.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.190
The future?

00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:59.100
You shouldn't come to Ark Cradle.

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:05.700
I saw you die at Ark Cradle.

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:12.650
Yusei is going to die?

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:16.330
If Yusei comes to Ark Cradle, 
that'll be his future.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:19.640
A certain person showed me that future.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:23.220
Yusei is going to die?  That's nonsense!

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:26.230
Who showed you that phony future?

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:27.430
Z-one.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:29.070
Z-one?

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:33.730
He is Ark Cradle's ruler 
and has the power of a god.

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:37.220
Yusei, we met him in the other dimension.

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:45.170
He's Z-one?

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:48.000
He's the one running Iliaster.

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:51.040
Z-one's plans are correct.

00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:56.020
Yusei, you'll die if you try 
to save Neo Domino City.

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:58.960
And the world in the 
future will be destroyed!

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:03.500
Sherry, you're fine if Neo 
Domino City is destroyed?

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:08.200
Thousands...  No, tens of 
thousands of people will die!

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:12.940
But those deaths will save 
billions of lives in the future.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:16.240
Including your life, Yusei.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:21.620
So much death won't lead 
to a peaceful future!

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:25.080
Destroying Neo Domino City is wrong!

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:28.290
You're going to die.

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:31.020
I won't know that until I try.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:34.540
Ma'am, where are you?

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:37.260
I'm at Ark Cradle.

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:39.510
He kidnapped you?

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:42.520
No, I'm here of my own free will.

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:45.980
Mizoguchi, forget about me.

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:47.440
Ma'am!

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:53.910
Yusei, if you try to stop Ark Cradle, 
I'll stop you with all my power.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:57.880
What?  You're going to be our enemy?

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:00.980
Why, Sherry?

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:04.070
I thought you hated Iliaster!

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:07.310
I changed my mind after I saw the future.

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:10.030
I'm not like you.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.500
Ma'am!

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:15.420
Sherry...

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:20.220
Riding Duels.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:23.380
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:30.180
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:37.960
Run!  The road of evolution 
leading to tomorrow

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:42.330
Is a new legendary duel

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:59.380
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:05.020
Set free your infinite potential

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:10.460
Every beginning is up to you

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:17.000
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:22.370
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:28.180
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:35.990
Become the gale and dance  
Cut through the darkness

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:41.360
Even if you can't see your destination

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:46.900
Run on your feet without fear

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:52.440
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:59.480
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:09.590
Bridge to the Future
Rainbow Bridge Bifrost

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:16.530
You told Yusei everything.

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:19.820
Yes, but he's definitely coming.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:23.710
He's not the type who's afraid of his future.

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:27.680
Why did you tell him about his future death?

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:31.490
I was being nice because I'm a friend.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:34.380
It symbolizes our breakup.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:37.180
I will stop them.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:49.260
What should we do?

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:56.980
We may be able to stop Ark Cradle if we 
strike its center with Moment's positive spin.

00:05:56.980 --> 00:06:04.820
But Team 5D's and Team Ragnarok's D-Wheels and the 
negatively-spinning old Moment are the only functioning Moments.

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:08.720
Can't we just use the old Moment's energy?

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:12.710
We can't use Moment's energy 
if it has negative spin!

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:15.190
Do you want Zero Reverse to happen again?

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:17.660
We have to find a way to get there.

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:21.580
But helicopters and planes 
are all powered by Moment.

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:24.110
There are no flying vehicles.

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:27.640
But there's definitely a way to get there.

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.130
Why do you think so, Yusei?

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:33.630
Because I'm there in Sherry's future.

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:36.980
That means I somehow managed to get there.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:39.430
You've worked backwards.

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:42.910
Yeah.  We need to find out how I get there.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:48.170
I don't want you to find out how.

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:53.710
You're going to die if you go there!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:57.090
You don't need to find out how!

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:58.570
Lua...

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:01.250
I don't want you to die!

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.290
Me neither!

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:05.850
Even if you save Neo Domino City-

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:08.250
Stop whining!

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:12.000
I'll change the future that she saw!

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.370
I won't let Yusei die!

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:14.340
Jack!

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:18.320
Jack, stop!  He's just a child!

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.900
Lua, don't worry.

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:26.800
Jack is right.  I won't die.

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:28.200
Yusei!

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:29.680
I'll be fine.

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:04.000
Our city is...

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:10.180
Jack, please be safe.

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:21.260
Yusei, you can't let that approach.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:25.510
That's the final Moment that will 
lead mankind to destruction.

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:29.240
Father, I've made my decision.

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:36.680
I can't let a tragedy like 
Zero Reverse happen again.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:41.420
Even if it costs me my life.

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:42.580
Yusei...

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:44.790
We want to talk.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.430
Team Ragnarok!

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:50.780
We'll build a bridge to Ark Cradle.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:53.230
What?  You can do that?

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:57.020
In Norse Mythology, Rainbow Bridge Bifrost

00:08:57.020 --> 00:09:02.180
connects the world of the gods 
to the world of the humans.

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:04.580
Rainbow Bridge Bifrost...

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:12.120
The god of light Heimdallr 
stands guard at Bifrost's base.

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:15.020
Today, the symbol of light is...

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:16.990
Symbol of light...

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:21.030
Are you talking about the old Moment?

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:26.750
That's right.  We will use the old 
Moment's energy to create Bifrost.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:30.080
We will use the powers 
of our D-Wheels and the

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:33.500
three Aesir to fix the old 
Moment's negative energy.

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:36.680
We'll build the bridge here.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:42.100
That's the Daedalus Bridge!

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:48.170
What's up?

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:50.430
I need you to do something.

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:53.280
Come down without alerting the others.

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:55.000
Okay.

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:57.330
Where are you going?

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:00.930
Umm...  To the bathroom!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:14.040
It's a bold idea to use the powers of 
the three Aesir and the old Moment.

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:17.300
Yusei, since you defeated Iliaster in the

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:21.670
WRGP, I know you can save 
the world from this threat.

00:10:22.030 --> 00:10:25.510
We'll do whatever it takes 
to get you to Ark Cradle.

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:27.750
That is our destiny.

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:30.030
You like destiny.

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:31.440
Hey!

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:33.400
I found a good one!

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:38.540
Okay.

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:42.210
This will work.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:44.190
We're ready!

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:45.660
Let's go!

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:57.870
What's this?

00:10:58.310 --> 00:10:59.300
Yusei!

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:01.090
Where is he going?

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:04.280
He's heading towards Satellite.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:05.750
Yusei!

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:08.100
Yusei, where are you going?

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:13.090
We'll build a road that connects 
the Daedalus Bridge to Ark Cradle!

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:14.690
What?

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:17.440
Why didn't you tell us?

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.060
I'm sorry.

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:21.580
I'm going to Ark Cradle alone.

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:23.820
Hurry up and evacuate!

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:25.620
Yusei!

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:27.060
That idiot!

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:28.580
Let's go after Yusei!

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:34.800
If only my D-Wheel worked...

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:38.540
Don't worry!  We promise 
to bring Sherry back!

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:41.060
In that case, take this card.

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:44.630
This card is...

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:50.120
She always carried that 
memento from her father.

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:54.200
If you meet her, please give it to her.

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:56.510
Okay.  I promise to give it to her!

00:11:57.560 --> 00:12:00.520
I'm counting on you, Team 5D's!

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:02.650
Good luck.

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:18.180
So this is the old Moment.

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:20.940
I'll start the preparations!

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:28.480
Daedalus Bridge.

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:34.810
Satellite's legendary hero flew 
towards the future at this bridge.

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:40.390
Godwin, I'll travel the same path as you!

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:44.870
Guide me in order to rescue Neo Domino City!

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:52.430
We're ready!

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:55.670
Bruno, get to safety.

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:56.510
Okay.

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:01.890
Let's go!

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:11.620
Valhallander, full power!

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:19.620
When the gate to the star world opens, the 
ancient god of battle swings its magical hammer!

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:23.840
As the earth trembles, it 
arrives with roaring thunder!

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:27.010
Come, Thor, Lord of the Aesir!

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:37.690
The fickle god from the Polar World, show us 
your absolute power and laugh at the world!

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:40.860
Descend, Loki, Lord of the Aesir!

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:47.880
The almighty king that rules 
the northern polar sky!

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:50.610
It's time to control the gods of the 
Polar World and show your authority!

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:52.040
Rule the heavens and earth!

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:57.560
The ultimate god, Odin, Father of the Aesir!

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:03.530
Moment understands the 
power of its controllers!

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:06.520
Give it everything we have!

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:25.910
The bridge that connects to the 
world of the gods!  Bifrost, appear!

00:14:49.140 --> 00:14:50.400
That's...

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:52.050
That's...

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.890
There's a road leading from Daedalus Bridge!

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:59.370
Rainbow Bridge Bifrost connects 
to the world of the gods.

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:01.860
Team Ragnarok, you did it!

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:07.070
The legendary hero is my idol!

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:10.590
Don't think you can cross that 
bridge without telling me!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:12.200
Everyone...

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.070
We're coming with you.

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:16.540
Yusei!

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:19.350
How did you get here?

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:23.840
I know more shortcuts in 
the BAD Area than you.

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:26.190
We drove here at full speed!

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.980
I'm glad we made it in time.

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:31.950
I'm going alone.

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:33.950
I don't know what dangers await!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:37.020
Yusei, we won't try to stop you.

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:40.910
Because we know that would be pointless.

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:43.710
But it's the same for us!

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:47.400
Even if you try to stop 
us, we're still going!

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:51.300
We won't sit back and watch you die!

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:56.330
Yusei, we promise to change your future.

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:02.340
That's right, Yusei!  I'm also 
a member of this powerful team!

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:04.150
You should count on me!

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:08.710
That's right.  We've always fought together.

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:10.510
That's what Team 5D's is all about!

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:19.080
Okay!  Let's save Neo Domino City!

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:20.810
Yeah!

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:26.700
Keep it together, everyone!

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:47.830
That's...

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:53.210
Yusei, you finally found a way to Ark Cradle.

00:16:53.520 --> 00:16:55.700
I'm counting on you to save her!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.930
Neo Domino City is also in your hands!

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:04.150
Is that Jack and the others?

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:09.540
Full speed ahead!

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:14.010
Crow, drive safely!

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:18.250
Yusei, I'm going too.

00:17:43.970 --> 00:17:47.270
The future Satellite is in ruins.

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:51.800
We're almost there!

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:54.700
Is that...

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:04.590
Valhallander!

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:08.240
This is the most we can do.

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:11.690
We leave the rest to you, Team 5D's!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:31.870
Team Ragnarok!

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:37.160
Bifrost is vanishing!

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:40.220
Yusei!

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:44.430
What happened?

00:18:45.650 --> 00:18:46.910
The road is disappearing!

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:49.250
They won't make it at that speed!

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:52.960
This is bad!  Aki's D-Wheel 
has the lowest horsepower!

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:53.870
Luca!

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:57.480
Are you okay, Aki?

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:00.910
Yusei, I can't drive any faster.

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.660
Luca, jump over here!

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:06.760
My D-Wheel has more power!

00:19:06.760 --> 00:19:09.650
If you have less weight, you'll speed up!

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.850
But we're driving too fast to jump!

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:15.350
If you don't, you won't survive!

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:18.820
I'll do it, Aki!

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:24.670
Luca!

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:26.520
Hurry!

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:27.720
Here I go!

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:36.780
Luca!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:53.410
Yusei, get in my slipstream and follow me!

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:55.100
Understood!

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:57.080
Aki, follow me!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:58.010
Okay!

00:20:08.210 --> 00:20:09.530
Luca!

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:11.440
Luca, thank goodness!

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:13.500
Sorry to make you worry.

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:15.450
Aki, are you okay?

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:17.290
Yeah.

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:19.650
Thank you.

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:22.460
Who are you?

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.790
I've lost my memories.

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:28.990
I came here to find them.

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:32.820
We don't have time for this.  You're 
fine as long as you're not our enemy!

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:35.070
Let's go!

00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:37.290
We're going to the center of Ark Cradle!

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:39.420
That's where Z-one is!

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:57.990
That's the center.

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:06.430
Ark Cradle's center...

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:09.250
Is this Moment energy?

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:11.450
Looks like it.

00:21:11.610 --> 00:21:13.710
What do we do now?

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:18.850
Yusei and Team 5D's are here.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:24.650
I'll welcome you to my castle Ark Cradle.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:27.000
What?

00:21:56.230 --> 00:22:01.470
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:01.570 --> 00:22:06.800
If we shed the same tears, 
let's laugh together

00:22:06.940 --> 00:22:12.180
Freed reality forms phrases 
in the piercing beat

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:14.910
Our hearts resonate

00:22:14.910 --> 00:22:20.150
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:20.280 --> 00:22:26.790
We'll find a place for us

00:22:28.690 --> 00:22:33.560
Waking in a dream  Stretch 
our hands toward the future

00:22:33.560 --> 00:22:38.600
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:39.340 --> 00:22:44.780
Repaint the darkness with 
the colors we envision

00:22:44.780 --> 00:22:53.350
Overlaying memories, bonds 
and hope creates future color

00:22:53.350 --> 00:22:58.960
We will draw it forever
